# melodic steps' cells at their fullest: every chord shape the cells name, on natural and accidental roots (T2),
# and notes: the widest names (sharps, octave -1), two notes, clusters (T3); every step with two tricks and a
# chance, some with a lock, some long. A cell's lines, the marks and the dot keep their place, held and playing (a
# held step's release clears it: its notes are written again); the layout audit fails the run if any of them meet
# or cross the cell's edge
